<A NAME="special"></a>
<p><font size=+1><b>Special Characters</b></font></p>
<UL>
Modern browsers support the display of special characters,  such as the &quot;degrees&quot;
symbol (&#176;).  There are a number of available characters.
<P>
<TABLE BORDER=1>
<TR><TD><FONT FACE="Verdana,Helvetica" SIZE="2"><B>Tag</B></FONT></TD><TD><FONT FACE="Verdana,Helvetica" SIZE="2"><B>Result</B></FONT></TD><TD WIDTH=20></TD>
<TD><FONT FACE="Verdana,Helvetica" SIZE="2"><B>Tag</B></FONT></TD><TD><FONT FACE="Verdana,Helvetica" SIZE="2"><B>Result</B></FONT></TD></TR>
<TR><TD><FONT FACE="Verdana,Helvetica" SIZE="2"><B>&#92;ch{</B>-&#62;<B>}</B></FONT></TD>
<TD><FONT FACE=SYMBOL>&#174;</FONT></TD><TD></TD>
<TD><B><FONT FACE="Verdana,Helvetica" SIZE="2">&#92;ch{</B>&#60;-<B>}</B></FONT></TD>
<TD><FONT FACE=SYMBOL>&#172;</FONT></TD></TR>
<TR><TD><FONT FACE="Verdana,Helvetica" SIZE="2"><B>&#92;ch{</B>t<B>}</B></FONT>
</TD><TD>&#134;</TD><TD></TD>
<TD><FONT FACE="Verdana,Helvetica" SIZE="2"><B>&#92;ch{</B>tt<B>}</B></FONT></TD>
<TD>&#135</TD></TR>
<TR><TD><FONT FACE="Verdana,Helvetica" SIZE="2"><B>&#92;ch{</B>dot<B>}</B></FONT></TD>
<TD>&#149;</TD><TD></TD>
